### 3) معماری کلی — Clean Architecture پیاده‌شده در Laravel

**لایه‌ها و مسیرها در ساختار پروژه:**

* `app/Domain/` — Entities (User, Profile, Listing, Match, PersonalityScore, Message, Room)
* `app/Repositories/` — Eloquent-based Repositories (UserRepository, ListingRepository,...)
* `app/Services/` — Business services (MatchingService, PersonalityService, ChatService)
* `app/Http/Controllers/Api/V1/` — API Controllers
* `app/Http/Requests/` — FormRequest validation classes
* `app/Events/` و `app/Listeners/` — Events system
* `app/Jobs/` — queued jobs (SendNotificationJob, RecomputeRecommendationsJob)
* `routes/api.php` — define API v1 routes
* `database/migrations/` — migrations
* `database/seeders/` — seeders

**Dependency Rule:**

* Presentation -> Application -> Domain -> Infrastructure
* Domain نباید به Laravel-specific code وابسته باشد؛ services و repository interfaces باید در Domain تعریف شوند و implementationها در Repositories قرار گیرند.

